                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='75875' id='137' type-v2='text' w='92431' x='3781' y='12250'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Purpose</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The dashboard was created to provide an overview of the main Talent Acquisition KPI&apos;s and their variations for the TA Operations team.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>1 - TA Metrics</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This view provides the current state of main metrics and their variations MoM and YoY. DHSE data can be filtered down by Department.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>2 - Budget Metrics</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This view provides the EoY Budget target and a forecast of future needed hires based on: Headcount, Confirmed Starters and Terminations and Attrition.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Definitions</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Actual</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Actual number of headcount.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Leavers Effective</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Number of employees with terminated contract on given month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Attrition</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Leavers Effective / Actual.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Hires</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Number of candidates having accepted an offer.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* % Female Hires</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Female over male on the given month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Starters</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Number of hired employees starting on a given month.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* CPS Score</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Candidate&apos;s overall satisfaction with the recruitment process. Average from 1 to 10.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* TTF</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: (Time to fill) Median of days between the day a JR is created and the day the first day of the hired candidate.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* TTH</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: (Time to hire) Median of days between the day the candidate is entered into the ATS and the handover to CoPs of the candidate.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* TTS</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: (Time to start) Median of days between the handover to CoPs and the first day of the hired candidate. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Last Month&apos;s Actual Headcount</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Actual HC value for the latest ended month (i.e.: if today is August 5th, it will show July&apos;s headcount).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Starters Confirmed</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: All confirmed starters from today&apos;s month until the end of year (December).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Terminations Confirmed</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: All confirmed terminations from today&apos;s month until the end of year (December).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Forecasted Headcount</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Last Month&apos;s Actual Headcount + Starters Confirmed - Terminations Confirmed.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Left to Hire</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: December 2022 HC Budget - Forecasted Headcount (if negative, it will show 0).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Attrition Hires</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Last Month&apos;s Actual Headcount </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>X</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> Estimated Attrition Rate equivalent for the remaining of the current year. (i.e.: if a yearly 20% attrition rate is estimated and we still have 6 months remaining of the current year, it will consider 10%).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* To Hire in 2022</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: Left to Hire + Attrition Hires.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
